# T3 review #2: a short press on PLAY acts on RELEASE (released before the 600 ms threshold); a
# long press switches the mode and never starts or stops either transport. Tested in STUDIO and
# in LIVE, entering and leaving.
wait 300
# T7a: enter the classic X0X pages (GLOBAL -> Classic patterns).
tap GLO
tap SEL
# STUDIO: during a short press the transport has not started; it starts on release
# T7a: the song is the edited object; seed its clips from the patterns just built.
songseed
press PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 0
release PLAY
wait 60
expect playing 1
tap PLAY
wait 60
expect playing 0
# STUDIO long press: never starts the transport, enters LIVE
press PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
wait 400
expect mode 1
wait 400
release PLAY
wait 20
expect playing 0
shot live_press.png
# LIVE: a short press starts the clip transport only on release
press PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 0
release PLAY
wait 60
expect playing 1
tap PLAY
wait 60
expect playing 0
# LIVE long press: never toggles the clip transport, leaves LIVE
press PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
wait 400
expect mode 0
release PLAY
wait 20
expect view 1
